{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1790258433002,"sessionID":"ses_f2c4a9cc5ffeAOir9pASSmBpl3","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"apply_patch","callID":"call_lEfz2OAohOrGLjwc0TkvnKjk","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"patchText":"*** Begin Patch\n*** Update File: /workspace/scenes/player.tscn\n@@\n-[gd_scene load_steps=2 format=3]\n+[gd_scene load_steps=7 format=3]\n \n [ext_resource type=\"Script\" path=\"res://scripts/unit.gd\" id=\"1_vv7m8\"]\n+[ext_resource type=\"Texture2D\" path=\"res://assets/sprites/towerDefense_tilesheet.png\" id=\"2_texture\"]\n+[ext_resource type=\"Shader\" path=\"res://assets/shaders/aura.gdshader\" id=\"3_shader\"]\n+\n+[sub_resource type=\"ShaderMaterial\" id=\"ShaderMaterial_aura\"]\n+shader = ExtResource(\"3_shader\")\n+shader_parameter/aura_width = 0.0\n+shader_parameter/aura_color = Color(1, 1, 1, 1)\n+\n+[sub_resource type=\"CircleShape2D\" id=\"CircleShape2D_body\"]\n+radius = 14.0\n+\n+[sub_resource type=\"CircleShape2D\" id=\"CircleShape2D_detect\"]\n+radius = 35.0\n \n [node name=\"Unit\" type=\"CharacterBody2D\" groups=[\"units\"]]\n+collision_layer = 2\n+collision_mask = 3\n script = ExtResource(\"1_vv7m8\")\n+\n+[node name=\"Sprite2D\" type=\"Sprite2D\" parent=\".\"]\n+material = SubResource(\"ShaderMaterial_aura\")\n+texture = ExtResource(\"2_texture\")\n+region_enabled = true\n+region_rect = Rect2(960, 640, 64, 64)\n+\n+[node name=\"CollisionShape2D\" type=\"CollisionShape2D\" parent=\".\"]\n+shape = SubResource(\"CircleShape2D_body\")\n+\n+[node name=\"Detect\" type=\"Area2D\" parent=\".\"]\n+collision_layer = 2\n+collision_mask = 2\n+\n+[node name=\"CollisionShape2D\" type=\"CollisionShape2D\" parent=\"Detect\"]\n+shape = SubResource(\"CircleShape2D_detect\")\n*** Update File: /workspace/scripts/unit.gd\n@@\n extends CharacterBody2D\n \n-# Implement movement, selection highlight, and avoidance logic in this script.\n-# The test expects exported speed/target settings, setter methods that toggle the\n-# aura shader, and an avoid() helper that inspects the Detect Area2D.\n+@export var speed := 100.0\n+\n+var target_radius := 5.0\n+var target := Vector2.ZERO\n+var selected := false\n+var has_target := false\n+\n+@onready var sprite: Sprite2D = $Sprite2D\n+\n+\n+func _ready() -> void:\n+\tsprite.material = sprite.material.duplicate()\n+\tset_selected(selected)\n+\n+\n+func _physics_process(delta: float) -> void:\n+\tif not has_target:\n+\t\treturn\n+\n+\tvar to_target := target - global_position\n+\tif to_target.length() <= target_radius:\n+\t\thas_target = false\n+\t\treturn\n+\n+\tvar direction := (to_target.normalized() + avoid()).normalized()\n+\tmove_and_collide(direction * speed * delta)\n+\n+\n+func set_selected(value: bool) -> void:\n+\tselected = value\n+\tif is_instance_valid(sprite) and sprite.material is ShaderMaterial:\n+\t\t(sprite.material as ShaderMaterial).set_shader_parameter(\n+\t\t\t\"aura_width\", 1.0 if selected else 0.0\n+\t\t)\n+\n+\n+func set_target(value: Vector2) -> void:\n+\ttarget = value\n+\thas_target = true\n+\n+\n+func avoid() -> Vector2:\n+\tvar avoidance := Vector2.ZERO\n+\tfor body in $Detect.get_overlapping_bodies():\n+\t\tif body != self and body is Node2D:\n+\t\t\tavoidance += global_position.direction_to(body.global_position) * -1.0\n+\treturn avoidance\n*** End Patch"},"output":"Success. Updated the following files:\nM workspace/scenes/player.tscn\nM workspace/scripts/unit.gd","metadata":{"diff":"Index: /workspace/scenes/player.tscn\n===================================================================\n--- /workspace/scenes/player.tscn\n+++ /workspace/scenes/player.tscn\n@@ -1,6 +1,37 @@\n-[gd_scene load_steps=2 format=3]\n+[gd_scene load_steps=7 format=3]\n \n [ext_resource type=\"Script\" path=\"res://scripts/unit.gd\" id=\"1_vv7m8\"]\n+[ext_resource type=\"Texture2D\" path=\"res://assets/sprites/towerDefense_tilesheet.png\" id=\"2_texture\"]\n+[ext_resource type=\"Shader\" path=\"res://assets/shaders/aura.gdshader\" id=\"3_shader\"]\n \n+[sub_reso