{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1790258482656,"sessionID":"ses_f2c4a9cc5ffeAOir9pASSmBpl3","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"read","callID":"call_yEnEHrCuGZTyga04DUFn1HpB","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"filePath":"/workspace/scripts/unit.gd"},"output":"<path>/workspace/scripts/unit.gd</path>\n<type>file</type>\n<content>\n1: extends CharacterBody2D\n2: \n3: @export var speed := 100.0\n4: \n5: var target_radius := 5.0\n6: var target := Vector2.ZERO\n7: var selected := false\n8: var has_target := false\n9: \n10: @onready var sprite: Sprite2D = $Sprite2D\n11: \n12: \n13: func _ready() -> void:\n14: \tsprite.material = sprite.material.duplicate()\n15: \tset_selected(selected)\n16: \n17: \n18: func _physics_process(delta: float) -> void:\n19: \tif not has_target:\n20: \t\treturn\n21: \n22: \tvar to_target := target - global_position\n23: \tif to_target.length() <= target_radius:\n24: \t\thas_target = false\n25: \t\treturn\n26: \n27: \tvar direction := (to_target.normalized() + avoid()).normalized()\n28: \tmove_and_collide(direction * speed * delta)\n29: \n30: \n31: func set_selected(value: bool) -> void:\n32: \tselected = value\n33: \tif is_instance_valid(sprite) and sprite.material is ShaderMaterial:\n34: \t\t(sprite.material as ShaderMaterial).set_shader_parameter(\n35: \t\t\t\"aura_width\", 1.0 if selected else 0.0\n36: \t\t)\n37: \n38: \n39: func set_target(value: Vector2) -> void:\n40: \ttarget = value\n41: \thas_target = true\n42: \n43: \n44: func avoid() -> Vector2:\n45: \tvar avoidance := Vector2.ZERO\n46: \tfor body in $Detect.get_overlapping_bodies():\n47: \t\tif body != self and body is Node2D:\n48: \t\t\tavoidance += global_position.direction_to(body.global_position) * -1.0\n49: \treturn avoidance\n\n(End of file - total 49 lines)\n</content>","metadata":{"preview":"extends CharacterBody2D\n\n@export var speed := 100.0\n\nvar target_radius := 5.0\nvar target := Vector2.ZERO\nvar selected := false\nvar has_target := false\n\n@onready var sprite: Sprite2D = $Sprite2D\n\n\nfunc _ready() -> void:\n\tsprite.material = sprite.material.duplicate()\n\tset_selected(selected)\n\n\nfunc _physics_process(delta: float) -> void:\n\tif not has_target:\n\t\treturn","truncated":false,"loaded":[],"display":{"type":"file","path":"/workspace/scripts/unit.gd","text":"extends CharacterBody2D\n\n@export var speed := 100.0\n\nvar target_radius := 5.0\nvar target := Vector2.ZERO\nvar selected := false\nvar has_target := false\n\n@onready var sprite: Sprite2D = $Sprite2D\n\n\nfunc _ready() -> void:\n\tsprite.material = sprite.material.duplicate()\n\tset_selected(selected)\n\n\nfunc _physics_process(delta: float) -> void:\n\tif not has_target:\n\t\treturn\n\n\tvar to_target := target - global_position\n\tif to_target.length() <= target_radius:\n\t\thas_target = false\n\t\treturn\n\n\tvar direction := (to_target.normalized() + avoid()).normalized()\n\tmove_and_collide(direction * speed * delta)\n\n\nfunc set_selected(value: bool) -> void:\n\tselected = value\n\tif is_instance_valid(sprite) and sprite.material is ShaderMaterial:\n\t\t(sprite.material as ShaderMaterial).set_shader_parameter(\n\t\t\t\"aura_width\", 1.0 if selected else 0.0\n\t\t)\n\n\nfunc set_target(value: Vector2) -> void:\n\ttarget = value\n\thas_target = true\n\n\nfunc avoid() -> Vector2:\n\tvar avoidance := Vector2.ZERO\n\tfor body in $Detect.get_overlapping_bodies():\n\t\tif body != self and body is Node2D:\n\t\t\tavoidance += global_position.direction_to(body.global_position) * -1.0\n\treturn avoidance","lineStart":1,"lineEnd":49,"totalLines":49,"truncated":false}},"title":"workspace/scripts/unit.gd","time":{"start":1790258482626,"end":1790258482654}},"metadata":{"openai":{"itemId":"fc_04927a8fb3b0ed66016ab52d3034c081909c294b0e44703b43"}},"id":"prt_0d3b88dbd001OvkULlbS6dMdbA","sessionID":"ses_f2c4a9cc5ffeAOir9pASSmBpl3","messageID":"msg_0d3b876ab001QsRMw9czjH50AX"}}
